text 5e0c6ada8144
<p>A fence with a language that no grammar knows:</p>
<pre class="md-code"><code>&lt;raw&gt; &amp; text</code></pre>
<p>A fence with no info string:</p>
<pre class="md-code"><code>plain &lt;text&gt;</code></pre>
<p>An indented block:</p>
<pre class="md-code"><code>indented &amp; plain</code></pre>
